WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000 line:75%
This is how I turn a business need into a
Power Platform solution:

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000 line:75%
from requirements to an application that can
be tested, installed and maintained.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.500 line:75%
I start by cross-checking the documents,
content and design supplied.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:23.000 line:75%
I turn each request into a clear scope,
acceptance criteria and an assessment of its
impact.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.000 line:75%
Next, I connect the user’s decisions in a
guided journey.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:35.000 line:75%
Each choice feeds the next screen and final
result, with coherent, responsive
navigation.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:43.000 line:75%
I organise the content in SharePoint:
catalogues, relationships, recommendations
and images.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:50.000 line:75%
The data model and dictionary explain what
each field stores and how it is used.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:56.500 line:75%
With Power Automate, I prepare the structure
and initial Excel data load.

00:00:56.500 --> 00:01:03.000 line:75%
Connections and environment variables make
the destination configurable, independent of
a development site.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:09.000 line:75%
In Power Apps, I implement reusable
components, formulas and loading states.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:15.000 line:75%
I review spacing, buttons, windows and
behaviour on desktop, tablet and mobile.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:40.000 line:75%
The next iteration adds prompts that use the
selected context.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:47.000 line:75%
The user chooses a mission, reviews the
text, copies it or emails it to themselves.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:54.500 line:75%
I validate what the user receives: correct
context, complete text, copying and email.

00:01:54.500 --> 00:02:02.000 line:75%
I also check regressions and presentation
with evidence from the test environment.

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:07.000 line:75%
The handover includes six documents:
installation, data model, dictionary,

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:12.000 line:75%
user manual, administration and version
record.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:17.000 line:75%
I use screenshots and instructions to
support knowledge transfer.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:24.500 line:75%
I prepare a package with the solution,
content and documentation aligned.

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:32.000 line:75%
I check versions, files and configuration so
another team can follow the installation
process.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:38.000 line:75%
When a change is needed, I assess its
impact, fix, test and update the affected
documents.

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:43.000 line:75%
Then I integrate the change in Git and
prepare the next handover.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:51.000 line:75%
My approach connects analysis, data,
development, testing and documentation.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:55.000 line:75%
The result is a traceable, maintainable
solution that is ready to evolve.
